      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَثَّ جُلَّتَهُ</span></b> , (T, O, K,) [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَثُ3َ</span></b> ,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَثٌّ</span>,
(T,) <i>He scattered the dates of his</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُلَّة</span> [or <i>receptacle made of palm-leaves</i>]. (T, O, * K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَثَّ المَآءَ الحَارَّ بِالبَارِدِ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَثُ3َ</span></b> , (M, TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَثٌّ</span>,
(TA,) <i>He abated,</i> or <i>allayed, the heat of the hot
water by means of the cold:</i> from Yaakoob. (M,
